sequenceDiagram
    %% 场景1：用户在设置页上传自定义头像
    participant U as User
    participant SA as SettingsActivity
    participant FPL as FilePickerLauncher
    participant SR as SettingsRepository
    participant AV as AvatarView
    participant FS as FileSystem(filesDir)

    U->>SA: 点击「我的头像」区域
    SA->>SA: 弹出选择对话框（预设 + 从相册上传按钮）
    U->>SA: 选择「从相册上传」
    SA->>FPL: launch("image/*")
    FPL->>U: 系统相册
    U->>FPL: 选取图片 (contentUri)
    FPL-->>SA: 回调 uri

    SA->>SA: contentResolver.openInputStream(uri)
    SA->>FS: 复制到 filesDir/avatars/user_avatar.jpg
    FS-->>SA: 返回绝对路径 path
    SA->>SR: userAvatarUri = path
    SR-->>SA: 持久化完成

    SA->>AV: bindImage(path)
    AV->>AV: loadSampledBitmap(path, avatarSize)
    alt Bitmap 解码成功
        AV->>AV: imageAvatar.setImageBitmap(bitmap)
        AV->>AV: textAvatarLetter.visibility = GONE
    else 解码失败
        AV->>AV: 回退 bindText(preset.glyph, preset.colorRes)
    end
    AV-->>U: 显示圆形头像

    %% 场景2：聊天页渲染用户头像
    Note over U,FS: ── 聊天页渲染用户头像 ──

    participant MA as MessageAdapter
    participant SR2 as SettingsRepository
    participant AV2 as AvatarView
    participant AP as AvatarPresets

    MA->>SR2: 读取 userAvatarUri
    SR2-->>MA: 返回 path (可能为空)

    alt path 非空且文件存在
        MA->>AV2: bindImage(path)
        AV2->>AV2: loadSampledBitmap → setImageBitmap
        AV2->>AV2: textAvatarLetter GONE
    else path 为空或文件不存在
        MA->>SR2: 读取 userAvatarIndex
        MA->>AP: user(index) → Preset(colorRes, glyph)
        MA->>AV2: bindText(glyph, colorRes)
        AV2->>AV2: textAvatarLetter.text = glyph
        AV2->>AV2: imageAvatar backgroundTint = color
    end

    %% 场景3：助手头像固定 logo
    Note over U,FS: ── 助手头像固定 logo ──

    participant MA3 as MessageAdapter
    participant AV3 as AvatarView

    MA3->>AV3: bindLogo(R.drawable.logo)
    AV3->>AV3: imageAvatar.setImageResource(R.drawable.logo)
    AV3->>AV3: imageAvatar.backgroundTint = transparent
    AV3->>AV3: textAvatarLetter.visibility = GONE
    Note over AV3: 不再读取 aiAvatarIndex
